 celeration in ultra‑relativistic jets
DESCRIPTION:Spectral lags are time delays between emission peaks observed a
 t different photon energies in the same high‑energy transient or variabl
 e source. In simple terms\, they quantify the fact that “hard” (high
 ‑energy) and “soft” (low‑energy) photons do not always arrive at e
 xactly the same time\, and thus provide a direct handle on how emission re
